\b EPDesk Old User Data Uploader\b0\par
\par
Internal tool of Excellent Publicity. Not for distribution outside the company.\par
\par
This program uploads the contents of an archived \i Users Data\i0  folder to the EPDesk service. It needs the EPDesk agent file-upload key to do so. Treat that key as a company secret: anything installed with it can write files into the EPDesk corpus.\par
\par
What it does on this machine:\par
\pard\sa60\li360
\bullet\tab Reads the folder you select, and no other location.\par
\bullet\tab Stores its settings, including the API key encrypted for your Windows account, under %LOCALAPPDATA%\\EPDeskOldDataUploader.\par
\bullet\tab Sends file contents over HTTPS to the EPDesk API and its storage provider. Nothing is sent anywhere else.\par
\pard\sa120
\par
Files uploaded through this tool are private company material and are retained by EPDesk under the same terms as files collected by the desktop agent.\par
